{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/extras/48279f186f1f3e6c451828e7aa23dd88.poster.avif?t=1773116776\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/extras/48279f186f1f3e6c451828e7aa23dd88.webm?t=1773116776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/extras/48279f186f1f3e6c451828e7aa23dd88.mp4?t=1773116776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Waking Ashes throws you into relentless combat across a world shattered by its own designer, Temple. You are its unwilling creation, dragged back from death time and time again, less out of compassion and more out of an obsessive clinical curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You claw your way through ruined landscapes and twisted creatures, chasing scraps of freedom in a place where stone, magic, and code have fused into unholy machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own fighting style from an upgradable arsenal of deadly weapons, strange powers and abilities. Blink through space, slow the flow of time, or unleash devastating tactical strikes. When the physical world grows too predictable, breach the boundary into The Deep Array\u2014a warped mirror reality where Temple\u2019s true form resides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero-gravity six-degree-of-freedom flight combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable, upgradable loadouts across primary, secondary, ability slots, and character attributes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast open world with progression and hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade consoles, lore logs, and ancient mini-bosses to uncover a haunting narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transition into the digital realm to overcome impossible odds in rogue-like challenges</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655430?t=1773116776","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/0bdfa4588e259d52ecf820375244b38e7261d42e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773116776","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/6c8018e487142d141b5b08209ce21d3938e1f417/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773116776","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/6c8018e487142d141b5b08209ce21d3938e1f417/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773116776","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4251830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/extras/48279f186f1f3e6c451828e7aa23dd88.poster.avif?t=1773116776\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/extras/48279f186f1f3e6c451828e7aa23dd88.webm?t=1773116776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/extras/48279f186f1f3e6c451828e7aa23dd88.mp4?t=1773116776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Waking Ashes throws you into relentless combat across a world shattered by its own designer, Temple. You are its unwilling creation, dragged back from death time and time again, less out of compassion and more out of an obsessive clinical curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You claw your way through ruined landscapes and twisted creatures, chasing scraps of freedom in a place where stone, magic, and code have fused into unholy machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own fighting style from an upgradable arsenal of deadly weapons, strange powers and abilities. Blink through space, slow the flow of time, or unleash devastating tactical strikes. When the physical world grows too predictable, breach the boundary into The Deep Array\u2014a warped mirror reality where Temple\u2019s true form resides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero-gravity six-degree-of-freedom flight combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable, upgradable loadouts across primary, secondary, ability slots, and character attributes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast open world with progression and hidden secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade consoles, lore logs, and ancient mini-bosses to uncover a haunting narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transition into the digital realm to overcome impossible odds in rogue-like challenges</p></li></ul>","developers":["Dan Carey Bailey"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655430/ada4e7b50b20a79744a2c9cf1e9fb6955233a5ce/header.jpg?t=1773116776","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3655430/1761509757/e3f0a558882f5dacae593d3ddc5642e28e42fa2a/1768715278/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768716620","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3655430/1761509757/e3f0a558882f5dacae593d3ddc5642e28e42fa2a/1768715278/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768716620","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"